# Copy this file to vault.env, fill in real values, then encrypt it (see
# README.md). Never commit vault.env itself, only the encrypted vault.env.age.
#
# Section markers (### name) become the filename setup.sh writes each
# service's variables into: ~/.config/interview-platform/env/<name>.env
#
# Quote any value containing a space, e.g. NAME="Jane Doe", not NAME=Jane Doe.
# direnv's dotenv parser errors on unquoted spaces.

### core-api
